    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.08_visual_discipline.chapters.flat.sections.01_thesis.concrete_anchor_1#typedgraphmittens" .
silm:instances_papers_08_visual_discipline_chapters_flat_sections_01_thesis_concrete_anchor_1#typedgraphmittens silm:hasLongDescription "The TypedGraphMittens is the typed graph (G, R, tau) for the Mittens taxonomy diagram — nodes are Mittens, Felis catus, TSN 183798; arrows are classification-leg, taxonomy-leg, identity arrows. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'TGraph_8', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
